commit 5624af22c5410c131e4dab796fa81d2338e54599
Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Tue Oct 20 00:08:24 2026 +0200

    feat(orchestrator): accumulate usage across all tool rounds

    `afterModelResponse` now receives the sum of inputTokens, outputTokens,
    and totalTokens across every provider call in a turn, not just the last
    round. A round reporting no usage is skipped rather than resetting the
    sum. Adds `addUsage` helper to orchestratorHelpers.

    Closes #93

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

